    <section class="fixed inset-x-4 bottom-4 z-[70] mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 text-ink shadow-2xl sm:p-6" data-tracking-consent-banner aria-labelledby="tracking-consent-heading" hidden>
        <h2 id="tracking-consent-heading" class="text-lg font-bold">Your tracking choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">We use optional analytics to understand how the site is used and optional advertising tracking to measure campaigns. Neither loads unless you choose it. Read our <a href="/privacy/" class="font-bold text-accent-ink underline">privacy policy</a>.</p>
